1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,162
Running a cloud kitchen can be chaos.

2
00:00:03,162 --> 00:00:05,135
Orders pile up.

3
00:00:05,135 --> 00:00:07,328
Ingredients run out.

4
00:00:07,328 --> 00:00:10,821
And rushed decisions can eat into your margin.

5
00:00:10,821 --> 00:00:12,806
Meet Cloudswitch.

6
00:00:12,806 --> 00:00:16,826
Your AI teammate, right in the kitchen group chat.

7
00:00:17,322 --> 00:00:22,707
It reads your orders, stock, market hours, and cook availability.

8
00:00:22,707 --> 00:00:26,457
Then it builds a practical buying and prep plan.

9
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:31,080
Ravi reports that green chillies are out of stock.

10
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:33,835
Cloudswitch checks the options.

11
00:00:33,835 --> 00:00:38,491
The extra trip is too expensive for forecast demand alone.

12
00:00:39,202 --> 00:00:43,277
Then eighteen confirmed paneer bowl orders arrive.

13
00:00:43,277 --> 00:00:45,803
Now the plan changes.

14
00:00:45,803 --> 00:00:50,120
Neha checks the costs, and approves in the same thread.

15
00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:53,443
Ravi gets the buying list.

16
00:00:53,443 --> 00:00:58,082
Asha gets eighteen bowls to prep, from five to six.

17
00:00:58,082 --> 00:01:02,077
The menu operator sees which dishes to pause.

18
00:01:02,077 --> 00:01:05,466
Everyone works from one approved plan.

19
00:01:06,128 --> 00:01:08,632
Fewer rushed decisions.

20
00:01:08,632 --> 00:01:12,148
A clearer path to a profitable kitchen.

21
00:01:12,148 --> 00:01:13,801
Cloudswitch.

22
00:01:13,801 --> 00:01:15,846
Made with Switch.
